I go into the bedroom.
A wardrobe stands next to the bed.
I put my suitcase on the bed.
I open the suitcase.
The suitcase lies open on the bed.
I put my clothes away.
I take my shirts.
The shirts now hang in the wardrobe.
My sweaters also lie in the wardrobe.
Then I sort my shoes.
The shoes stand in a row under the bed.
The suitcase is almost empty.
Everything is tidy now.
